(14237, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 155, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This lotus pagoda national trend gift set with 316 stainless steel temperature display cup fits military veteran season and corporate souvenir gifting.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This elegant national trend gift set adopts classic lotus and pagoda printing design, equipped with a 316 stainless steel temperature-sensing thermos and automatic folding sun rain umbrella. A wide range of combination options from single cup to 7-piece full sets are offered in red, blue and green, with custom logo printing service for veteran memorial events, corporate meetings, staff welfare and promotional advertising gifts.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Distinctive Chinese lotus pagoda national trend printed appearance</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">316 stainless steel inner thermos with digital temperature display lid</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete matching gift box and tote bag packaging for formal gifting</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Single Thermos, Thermos + Pen, Thermos + Pen + USB Drive, Thermos + Pen + Power Bank, Thermos + Umbrella, Thermos + Pen + Notebook, Thermos + Umbrella + Pen + Notebook, Thermos + Umbrella + Pen + Notebook + USB Drive, Thermos + Pen + Notebook + USB + Power Bank, Thermos + Umbrella + Pen + Notebook + USB + Speaker + Power Bank (available in red, blue, green for He Li / Hong Yun Dang Tou series)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">316 stainless steel (thermos liner), metal, plastic, fabric umbrella, coated paper gift box</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Veteran season commemorative gifts, corporate conferences, employee welfare rewards, client appreciation, promotional advertising giveaways, holiday business souvenirs</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Custom logo printing service available. Pictures are for reference only, actual accessories vary by selected combination.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Corporate &amp; Veteran Events → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Colleagues &amp; Veterans → Product Type → National Trend Thermos Umbrella Gift Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:24:16', '2026-07-23 17:24:16'),
