(14255, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 156, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This vintage Chinese office gift set with portable leather case supports custom logo for corporate group gifting and client presents.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This sophisticated traditional Chinese office gift set features daily workplace essentials, including a 304 lined ceramic tea mug, solid wood ballpoint pen, tassel bookmark and ruyi-shaped USB drive, stored inside a textured portable leather suitcase gift box. Multiple 2-piece to 6-piece matching combinations are offered in black, red and blue tones, with custom logo printing available for corporate bulk orders, graduation gifts and holiday employee rewards.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Classic vintage Chinese aesthetic with ruyi USB and tassel bookmark decorations</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">304 lined ceramic office tea mug for daily hot beverage brewing</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Sturdy portable leather suitcase gift box for premium presentation and easy carrying</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">4-Piece (Office Mug + Bookmark + Wood Pen + Ruyi USB), 3-Piece (Notebook + Wood Pen + Office Mug), 4-Piece (Notebook + Wood Pen + USB + Office Mug), 6-Piece (Notebook + Wood Pen + USB + Office Mug + Dual Bookmarks), 2-Piece (Hair Dryer + Office Mug / Massage Gun + Office Mug / Neck Massager + Office Mug / Temp Cup + Office Mug + Auto Umbrella), available in black, red, blue</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">304 stainless steel (mug liner), ceramic, solid wood, metal, faux leather gift case</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Corporate bulk group orders, client appreciation, teacher gifts, graduation souvenirs, Spring Festival &amp; holiday welfare, conference meeting favors, housewarming presents</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Custom logo printing service available. Pictures are for reference only, actual accessories vary by selected combination.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Corporate Events → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Colleagues &amp; Clients → Product Type → Chinese Style Office Gift Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:24:22', '2026-07-23 17:24:22'),
