(14291, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 157, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This automatic stirring coffee mug gift set is a practical branded souvenir for graduation, opening ceremonies and client gifting.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This modern business gift set centers on an electric self-stirring coffee mug with 316 stainless steel inner liner, which mixes coffee, milk powder and cocoa automatically. It comes with an elegant orange gift box and matching carry bag, supporting custom logo printing. Multiple accessory combinations including power bank, umbrella, neck massager, notebook and more are offered in white and brown tones to fit various corporate gifting needs.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Built-in electric stirring function for effortless beverage mixing</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Food contact safe 316 stainless steel inner liner for daily use</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete orange gift box and tote bag packaging with custom branding support</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Single Stirring Mug, Mug + Power Bank, Mug + Umbrella, Mug + Neck Massager, Mug + Neck Massager + Power Bank, Mug + Power Bank + Umbrella, Mug + Pen + Notebook + Umbrella, Mug + Power Bank + Notebook + 32G USB + Pen, Mug + Power Bank + Notebook + 32G USB + Pen + Umbrella, Mug + Power Bank + Neck Massager + Umbrella, Mug + Neck Massager + Hair Dryer, Mug + Earbuds + Power Bank + Umbrella + Hair Dryer, Mug + Earbuds + Power Bank + Umbrella + Neck Massager (all styles available in white / brown)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">316 stainless steel (mug inner liner), plastic mug shell, coated paper gift box</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Graduation ceremonies, company opening events, client appreciation, employee welfare rewards, conference souvenirs, holiday corporate gifts, promotional advertising giveaways</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Custom logo printing service available. Pictures are for reference only, actual accessories vary by selected combination.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Corporate Events → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Colleagues &amp; Clients → Product Type → Electric Stirring Mug Gift Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:24:29', '2026-07-23 17:24:29'),
