(14315, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 158, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Elegant Chinese landscape themed gift set ideal for Lunar New Year corporate client gifting and annual events.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This sophisticated Chinese-style gift set features a ceramic tea storage canister paired with an insulated tumbler, plus a complimentary greeting card, all housed in a black gift box printed with delicate golden mountain cloud artwork. Multiple matching combinations are available including travel tea sets, neck massagers and titanium tumblers in various tones, perfect for corporate annual galas, Spring Festival presents and client appreciation gestures.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Classic Chinese landscape golden print gift box with premium presentation</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ceramic tea canister paired with insulated tumbler for daily tea brewing</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Multiple customizable matching combinations for different corporate gifting budgets</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Year of Horse Travel Tea Set (White), Phoenix Dancong Tea Canister + Lock&amp;Lock Thermos (White), Phoenix Dancong Tea Canister + Year of Horse Travel Tea Set, Phoenix Dancong Tea Canister + Konka Neck Massager (White), Phoenix Dancong Tea Canister + Titanium Tumbler (Silver / Orange / Pink / Black)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ceramic (tea canister), metal (thermos inner liner), coated paper (gift box)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Corporate annual meetings, Spring Festival gifts, client appreciation, employee welfare rewards, graduation souvenirs, housewarming gifts, business conference favors</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Custom logo printing service available. Pictures are for reference only, actual accessories vary by selected combination.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Corporate Events → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Colleagues &amp; Clients → Product Type → Chinese Style Tea Gift Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:24:36', '2026-07-23 17:24:36'),
