(14343, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 159, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This elegant national trend office gift set is perfect for custom logo corporate events and client gifting.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This sophisticated national trend themed gift set is equipped with daily office essentials, including a 450ml temperature display thermos made of 304 stainless steel, A5 notebook with traditional Chinese round buckle, metal ballpoint pen, dual-purpose mobile USB drive and automatic folding umbrella. Multiple combination options from 2-piece to 7-piece are available in black, red, blue, gold and silver. Custom logo printing is supported, suitable for corporate conferences, graduation ceremonies, employee benefits and client appreciation gifts.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Classic Chinese national trend design with traditional round buckle notebook decoration</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">304 stainless steel temperature sensing display thermos for daily hot drink storage</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Diverse combination packages to match different corporate budget demands</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">2-Piece (Notebook + Pen), 3-Piece (Thermos + Notebook + Pen), 4-Piece (Thermos + Notebook + Pen + USB Drive / Thermos + Notebook + Pen + Umbrella), 5-Piece (Thermos + Notebook + Pen + Umbrella + USB Drive), 7-Piece (Thermos + Notebook + Pen + Umbrella + USB Drive + Speaker + Power Bank), available in black, red, blue, gold, silver</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">304 stainless steel (thermos), PU leather (notebook), metal (pen), plastic (USB drive, umbrella frame)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Corporate conferences, company anniversary events, graduation souvenirs, employee welfare rewards, client appreciation gifts, promotional advertising giveaways, holiday business gifts</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Custom logo printing service available. Pictures are for reference only, actual accessories vary by selected combination.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Corporate Events → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Colleagues &amp; Clients → Product Type → Chinese Style Office Gift Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:24:44', '2026-07-23 17:24:44'),
