(14393, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 161, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">A practical portable summer gift set ideal for graduation, corporate and school event souvenirs.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This minimalist summer gift set is packed with daily outdoor essentials, featuring a 316 stainless steel temperature display coffee cup, compact handheld fan and UV protection sun rain umbrella. Multiple color and combination options are available, matched with premium gift boxes, and custom logo printing is supported for graduation ceremonies, bank promotions and corporate anniversary activities.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Built with food-grade 316 stainless steel coffee cup with temperature screen lid</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Portable summer cooling accessories for daily commuting and outdoor use</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Multiple color and matching combinations with customizable logo gift packaging</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">2-Piece: 316 Coffee Cup + Hand Fan (Blue / Red / Orange / White)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">3-Piece: 316 Coffee Cup + Hand Fan + Umbrella (Blue / Red / Orange / White)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">3-Piece: 316 Coffee Cup + Hand Fan + Magnetic Power Bank (Blue / Red / Orange / White)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">2-Piece: 316 Coffee Cup + Massage Gun (Blue / Black / Orange)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">2-Piece: Magnetic Power Bank + Massage Gun (Blue / Black / Orange)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">3-Piece: 316 Coffee Cup + Magnetic Power Bank + Massage Gun (Blue / Black / Orange)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">316 stainless steel, plastic, fabric umbrella</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Graduation ceremonies, school events, bank opening promotions, corporate anniversaries, employee welfare, student souvenirs, client appreciation gifts</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Custom logo printing service available. Pictures are for reference only, actual contents vary by selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Corporate &amp; Graduation Events → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Students &amp; Clients → Product Type → Summer Portable Gift Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:24:58', '2026-07-23 17:24:58'),
