(14460, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 164, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Keep employees and clients cool with this practical summer-themed corporate gift set.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This practical summer-themed gift set is designed for comfort and utility, featuring items such as a smart temperature-controlled cup with LED display, hands-free neck fan, UV-protective umbrella, and more, depending on the variant. Available in multiple vibrant colors (blue, red, orange, pink), the set comes in premium gift packaging with custom logo printing options, ideal for corporate events, employee rewards, and promotional giveaways.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Practical summer essentials for work and outdoor activities</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Multiple vibrant color options to match your brand style</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Premium gift box packaging with custom logo printing available</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Smart Cup + Neck Fan, Power Bank + Neck Fan, Neck Fan + Umbrella, Smar