(14534, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 167, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Delight bridesmaids and wedding guests with this elegant purple-themed gift set, perfect for special occasions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This curated purple-themed gift set is designed to express heartfelt gratitude to bridesmaids, wedding guests, or event attendees. Depending on the variant, it includes items such as scented plant-based hand cream, orchid hair clip, aromatic sachet, camellia plaster scent ornament, and a decorative notebook. The delicate purple and floral design adds a touch of romance, making it suitable for weddings, bridal showers, yoga studio openings, and other celebratory occasions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Elegant purple-themed design with delicate floral motifs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Curated set of practical and sentimental items (hand cream, hair clip, sachet, etc.)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Luxury gift box packaging, perfect for weddings and special events</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Style 1, Style 2, Style 3, Style 4, Style 5, Style 6, Style 7, Style 8, Custom Combination Style, 902 Pen</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Metal (hardware), paper (notebook), plastic (hand cream tube), fabric (sachet)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Weddings, bridal showers, yoga studio openings, birthday parties, corporate events, holiday gatherings, client appreciation gifts</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pictures are for reference only. Actual contents vary by selected option. Custom combinations are available upon request.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Wedding → By Color → Purple → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Wedding Favor Gift Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:25:34', '2026-07-23 17:25:34'),
