(14594, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 170, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Impress clients with this koi fish themed premium business gift set, featuring custom branding options.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This elegant koi fish themed gift set combines traditional Chinese symbolism with practical office accessories, including a 316 stainless steel coffee cup, multi-port power bank, and other premium items, depending on the variant. The vibrant koi design represents good fortune, making it ideal for corporate events, client appreciation, and holiday gifting, with custom logo printing available for branding.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Traditional koi fish design symbolizing good fortune and prosperity</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Curated set of practical premium office accessories (coffee cup, power bank, etc.)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Premium gift box packaging with custom logo printing options</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Coffee Cup + Power Bank Set, Coffee Cup + Umbrella Set, Coffee Cup + Neck Massager Set, Coffee Cup + Pen + Notebook Set, Coffee Cup + Power Bank + Neck Massager Set, Coffee Cup + Power Bank + Umbrella Set, Coffee Cup + Neck Massager + Umbrella Set, Coffee Cup + Pen + Notebook + Power Bank Set, Coffee Cup + Pen + Notebook + Umbrella Set, Coffee Cup + Neck Massager + Power Bank + Umbrella Set</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">316 stainless steel (cup), plastic (power bank, umbrella), fabric (notebook)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Corporate events, client appreciation, employee rewards, holiday gifting, new year celebrations, business meetings, promotional giveaways</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Custom logo printing is available. Pictures are for reference only. Actual contents vary by selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Corporate Events → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Colleagues &amp; Clients → Product Type → Themed Corporate Gift Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:25:50', '2026-07-23 17:25:50'),
