(14710, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 175, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Throw a spooky-fun celebration with this Coraline themed birthday party supplies set.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This all-in-one kit features iconic motifs from the movie Coraline, including the button eyes, black cat, and spooky house. It includes tableware, a themed tablecloth, hanging spirals, balloons, and cake/cupcake toppers, all in moody blues and purples. It’s perfect for fans of the film’s eerie and whimsical aesthetic.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Iconic Coraline-inspired design with button eyes, the black cat, and the spooky house</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Complete bundle with tableware, decor, and dessert accessories</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Moody blue and purple color scheme matching the movie’s atmosphere</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Coraline themed plates, cups, and utensils</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">\"Happy Birthday\" banner</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Hanging spiral decorations with button-eye motifs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">12-inch latex balloons</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Large cake topper</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Assorted cupcake toppers</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Coraline printed tablecloth</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Paper, plastic utensils, latex balloons</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Size:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Balloons: 12 inches; cake topper: approx. 15 cm tall</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Movie-themed birthday parties, Halloween celebrations, kids’ spooky-themed events, Coraline fan gatherings</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Balloons ship uninflated. Not suitable for ovens, microwaves, or direct heat unless officially stated.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Birthday Parties → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Party Tableware &amp; Decor Sets</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:26:25', '2026-07-23 17:26:25'),
