(14730, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 176, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Thank your loved ones with this elegant red wedding favor gift box set, perfect for sharing gratitude on your special day.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This curated red gift box set is designed to express heartfelt thanks to wedding guests, bridesmaids, and loved ones. Depending on the variant, it may include a rose bouquet, scented candle, hand cream, candy box, and a complimentary greeting card. The vibrant red design with traditional motifs adds a touch of cultural charm, making it suitable for weddings, baby showers, and other celebratory occasions.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vibrant red gift box with traditional motifs and elegant finish</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Curated set with practical and sentimental items (rose bouquet, scented candle, hand cream, etc.)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Versatile for weddings, baby showers, and various celebratory occasions</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rose Bouquet + S