(14754, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 177, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create a warm, festive Thanksgiving table with this all-in-one party supplies set.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This comprehensive kit includes “Give Thanks” banners, fall-colored paper fans, turkey-themed tableware (plates, cups, napkins, utensils), a coordinating tablecloth, and honeycomb centerpieces. Featuring classic Thanksgiving motifs like turkeys, pumpkins, and fall leaves in warm orange, red, and yellow hues, it’s perfect for family dinners, potlucks, or classroom celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete Thanksgiving tableware + decor bundle</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Warm autumnal color palette with iconic holiday designs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Disposable, durable construction ideal for large gatherings</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">“Give Thanks” pennant banner</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Orange/red paper fans</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9-inch dinner plates</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">7-inch dessert plates</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">9-oz paper cups</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Thanksgiving-themed napkins</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Orange plastic utensils (knives, forks, spoons)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Thanksgiving tablecloth</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Turkey/pumpkin honeycomb centerpieces</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">“Happy Thanksgiving” cake topper</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Paper, plastic utensils</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Size:</span></p><p><