cent + Hand Cream + Candy Box Set, Rose Bouquet + Cup + Candy Box Set, Hair Dryer + Comb + Candy Box Set, Towel + Umbrella + Scent + Hand Cream Set, Towel + Cup Set, Towel + Candy Box + Scent + Hand Cream Set, Towel + Comb + Scent + Hand Cream Set, Towel + Electric Toothbrush + Scent + Hand Cream Set, Towel + Comb + Toothbrush Set, Towel + Hair Dryer Set, Cup + Candy Box + Jar + Scent + Hand Cream Set</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ceramic (cup) + Other materials (varies by option)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Weddings, bridal showers, baby showers, birthdays, graduation parties, housewarmings, corporate events, holiday gatherings</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pictures are for reference only. Actual contents vary by selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Wedding → By Color → Red → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Wedding Favor Gift Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:26:44', '2026-07-23 17:26:44'),
