-ZQ04, 5-ZQ05, 5-ZQ06, 5-ZQ07, 5-ZQ08, 5-ZQ09, 5-ZQ10, 5-ZQ11, 5-ZQ12, 5-ZQ13, 5-ZQ14, 5-ZQ15, 5-ZQ16, 5-ZQ17, 5-ZQ18, 5-ZQ19, 5-ZQ20</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Latex, Aluminum Foil</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Size:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">5\", 10\", 12\", 18\"</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Soccer-themed birthdays, World Cup watch parties, sports fan celebrations, boys’ birthday parties, school sports events</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Balloons are shipped uninflated. Pictures are for reference only.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Party → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Balloon Garland Kit</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:27:44', '2026-07-23 17:27:44'),
