><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Soccer ball cutout banner: 1 set</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Green honeycomb balls: 8 pcs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Each pennant measures 12.5 × 19.5 cm, soccer balls measure 16 cm, honeycomb balls measure 10 cm</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Printed cardstock, paper honeycomb</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">World Cup watch parties, soccer-themed events, game day celebrations, fan gatherings, international sports parties</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No additional notes.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Sports &amp; Game Day Parties → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Themed Party Decor Sets</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:35:47', '2026-07-23 17:35:47'),
