(16817, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 260, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Kickflip into the fun with this edgy skateboard-themed birthday party decoration set.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This bold, street-style set includes a glittery \"Happy Birthday\" banner, matching skateboard-themed swirls, cake toppers, and honeycomb table decor. The vibrant black, red, and yellow design features skater silhouettes, making it perfect for skateboard fans’ birthdays and extreme sports-themed celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete skateboard-themed decoration set with banner, swirls, cake toppers, and table decor</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Bold street-style design featuring skater silhouettes and skateboard graphics</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Lightweight, DIY-friendly design for indoor use</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Y-00632-1 Skateboard Birthday Banner, Y-00632-2 Pattern Banner, Y-00632-3 1pc Large Cake Topper, Y-00632-4 16pcs Small Cupcake Toppers, Y-00632-5 9pcs Honeycomb Decor, Y-00633 Skateboard Swirl Set</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Paper (banner, cutouts, toppers, honeycomb decor) + Plastic (swirls)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Skateboard-themed birthday parties, sports celebrations, boys’ birthdays, extreme sports events, themed parties</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pictures are for reference only. Some assembly is required.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Birthday → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Party Decoration Kit</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:35:56', '2026-07-23 17:35:56'),
