span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Printed cardstock, twine</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Summer birthdays, bee-themed parties, honey-themed celebrations, kids’ garden parties, outdoor summer gatherings</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">No additional notes.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Birthday Parties → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Themed Party Decor Sets</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:36:11', '2026-07-23 17:36:11'),
