(17299, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 280, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rev up the fun with this complete monster truck-themed birthday party decoration set.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This bold, action-packed set includes a monster truck-themed \"Happy Birthday\" banner, hanging swirls with truck cutouts, and optional accessories like honeycomb table decor, glasses, and a background cloth. The vibrant design features colorful monster trucks, flames, and racing details, making it perfect for kids’ birthdays and racing-themed celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete monster truck-themed decoration set with banners, swirls, and optional accessories</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Bold, colorful design featuring monster trucks, flames, and racing motifs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Lightweight, DIY-friendly design for indoor use</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Y-00277-1 Letter Banner, Y-00277-2 Pattern Banner, Y-00277-3 Swirl Set (9 cards + 9 swirls + hooks), Y-00539 9pcs Honeycomb Decor, Y-00538 8pcs Glasses, Y-00602 Monster Truck Background Cloth, G-00133 6pcs Racing Headbands, Y-00649 7pcs Monster Truck Strings</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Paper (banner, cutouts, honeycomb decor) + Plastic (swirls)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Children’s birthday parties, monster truck-themed celebrations, racing events, boys’ birthdays, themed parties</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pictures are for reference only. Some assembly is required.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Birthday → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Party Decoration Kit</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:38:31', '2026-07-23 17:38:31'),
