(17507, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 288, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Transform your party into an underwater wonderland with this complete mermaid-themed birthday decoration set.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This vibrant all-in-one set includes a mermaid scale \"Happy Birthday\" banner, themed balloons, hanging swirls, cake toppers, and accessories like a headband and sash. The pastel purple and blue color scheme creates a magical under-the-sea atmosphere, perfect for kids’ birthdays, summer parties, and mermaid-themed celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete mermaid-themed decoration set with banners, balloons, and accessories</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Magical under-the-sea design featuring mermaid tails, seashells, and starfish</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Lightweight, DIY-friendly design for indoor use</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Y-00672-1 Banner + 8pcs Swirls + 1pc Headband, Y-00547 Honeycomb Decor, Y-00642 8pcs Mermaid Masks, Y-00549 Background Cloth, Y-00672-2 Sash, Full Party Set, Y-00570 30pcs Photo Props, Y-00672-3 Cake Topper Set, Y-00252 Cake Stand, Y-00302 Cake Wrappers, Y-00672-4 24pcs Balloons</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Paper, Fabric, Latex</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Children’s birthday parties, mermaid-themed celebrations, summer parties, kids’ events, themed birthday parties</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Pictures are for reference only. Some assembly is required. Balloons are shipped uninflated.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Birthday → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Party Decoration Kit</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:39:42', '2026-07-23 17:39:42'),
