(17603, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 292, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create a cool winter wonderland vibe with this ice skating themed birthday banner and hanging swirl set.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This winter-themed set includes a glittery light blue \"Happy Birthday\" banner decorated with snowflakes and ice skater silhouettes, plus matching hanging swirls with ice skates, snowflakes, and figure skater cutouts. The lightweight decorations are easy to hang indoors, creating a frosty, festive look perfect for ice skating-themed birthdays and winter celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Glittery light blue \"Happy Birthday\" banner with ice skating motifs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes matching hanging swirl decorations with snowflake and skater cutouts</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Lightweight, easy-to-hang design for indoor use</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">L-00497-1 Birthday Banner, L-00497-2 9pcs Swirl Set</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0