(17649, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 294, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Add edgy rock-and-roll flair to your celebration with this \"Born to Rock\" banner and hanging swirl decoration set.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This vibrant set includes a \"Born to Rock\" letter banner and matching hanging swirls with rock-themed cutouts like skulls, electric guitars, music notes, and leather jackets. The lightweight decorations are easy to assemble and hang, creating a bold, energetic atmosphere perfect for rock music-themed birthdays, 80s throwback parties, and music events.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Bold \"Born to Rock\" letter banner with glittery black lettering</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Includes matching hanging swirl decorations with rock-themed cutouts</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Lightweight, DIY-friendly design for indoor or outdoor use</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Y-00395-1 (12 cards + 12 swirls + hooks), Y-00395-2 (letter banner), Y-00395-3 (pattern banner), Y-00396 (9 pcs set), Y-00564 (8 rock glasses)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Paper (banner and cutouts) + Plastic (swirls)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Rock music-themed parties, birthday parties, 80s throwback events, music celebrations, themed gatherings</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Pictures are for reference only. Some assembly is required.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Party → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Party Banner &amp; Garland Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:40:25', '2026-07-23 17:40:25'),
