(17673, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 295, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Add cheerful tropical charm to your summer events with this \"Hello Summer\" banner and hanging swirl decoration set.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This vibrant set includes a \"Hello Summer\" letter banner, each decorated with colorful summer motifs, plus matching hanging swirls with tropical cutouts. The lightweight decorations are easy to hang indoors or outdoors, creating a festive look perfect for luaus, beach parties, birthdays, and backyard summer gatherings.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Bright \"Hello Summer\" letter banner with tropical-themed letter flags</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Includes matching hanging swirl decorations with summer cutouts</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Lightweight, easy-to-hang design for indoor or outdoor use</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">L-00430-1 \"Hello Summer\" Banner, L-00430-2 Hanging Swirl Set</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Paper (banner and cutouts) + Plastic (swirls)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Summer parties, Hawaiian luaus, beach parties, birthday parties, backyard gatherings, seasonal celebrations</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Pictures are for reference only.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Party → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Party Banner &amp; Garland Set</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:40:35', '2026-07-23 17:40:35'),
