(17987, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 309, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Make a bold, vibrant statement with this pink and orange starburst balloon garland kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">This eye-catching 137-piece kit features a lively mix of pink, orange, and gold latex balloons, accented with dramatic starburst foil balloons. It includes balloons in multiple sizes plus all assembly tools, perfect for creating a fun, bold backdrop for summer parties, birthdays, or tropical-themed events.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Bold pink, orange, and gold color scheme with starburst accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">All-in-one 137-piece kit with full assembly tools</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Durable latex balloons in various sizes for layered decor</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Package Includes:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">22-inch starburst foil balloons (pink, orange, purple): 3 pcs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Hot pink latex balloons (18-inch: 2 pcs, 12-inch: 10 pcs, 10-inch: 10 pcs, 5-inch: 15 pcs)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Orange latex balloons (18-inch: 2 pcs, 12-inch: 10 pcs, 10-inch: 10 pcs, 5-inch: 15 pcs)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Light pink latex balloons (12-inch: 10 pcs, 10-inch: 10 pcs, 5-inch: 15 pcs)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Gold latex balloons (12-inch: 10 pcs, 5-inch: 15 pcs)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Glue dots: 20 pcs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Balloon arch strip (16 ft): 1 pc</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Latex, foil</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Birthday parties, summer celebrations, tropical-themed events, girls’ parties, photo backdrops</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Balloons are shipped uninflated.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">By Occasion → Birthday Parties → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Balloon Garlands</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:42:07', '2026-07-23 17:42:07'),
