 class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Hot pink latex balloons (18-inch: 2 pcs, 12-inch: 10 pcs, 10-inch: 10 pcs, 5-inch: 15 pcs)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Orange latex balloons (18-inch: 2 pcs, 12-inch: 10 pcs, 10-inch: 10 pcs, 5-inch: 15 pcs)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Light pink latex balloons (12-inch: 10 pcs, 10-inch: 10 pcs, 5-inch: 15 pcs)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Gold latex balloons (12-inch: 10 pcs, 5-inch: 15 pcs)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Glue dots: 20 pcs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Balloon arch strip (16 ft): 1 pc</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Latex, foil</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Birthday parties, summer celebrations, tropical-themed events, girls’ parties, photo backdrops</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Balloons are shipped uninflated.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(28, 31, 35);\">By Occasion → Birthday Parties → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Balloon Garlands</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:42:53', '2026-07-23 17:42:53'),
