(18357, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 324, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description: Gentle pastel balloon set creates sweet soft wall backdrops for baby and children birthday gatherings.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description: This all-in-one children birthday decor pack includes unique cloud foil balloon, multicolor paper letter banner and star foil ornaments, matched with mixed confetti and solid macaron latex balloons. Matching balloon inflator and dot glue simplify full backdrop assembly for family guests. Multiple SKU variants and optional 32-inch number foil balloons fit different age birthday themes.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sweet mixed macaron pastel color matching for kid birthday scenes</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Cute cloud shaped aluminum foil balloon with colorful streamer details</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Comes with balloon inflator and dot glue for quick setup</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes: 1 macaron Happy Birthday letter banner, 1 silver triangle pennant garland, 1 smiling cloud foil balloon, pink star foil balloons, printed latex balloons, silver confetti latex balloons, pink/blue/yellow macaron latex balloons, 1 balloon inflator, 1 pack dot glue; Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options: SKU series 701,702,703,704,705,706,707,708,709,710,711,712,713,714,715,716,717,718,719,720,721,722,723,724,725,726,727,728,729,730,731,732,733,734,735,736,737,738,739,740,741,742; Optional 32-inch number foil balloon (leave note for required color &amp; number)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material: Aluminum foil, latex, coated paper</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Size: 10-inch latex balloons, optional 32-inch number foil balloons</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For: Baby birthday parties, children birthday parties, Children’s Day celebration, birthday wall backdrop decoration</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note: Balloons are shipped uninflated; balloon stand and extra decorative props shown in pictures are not included.</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Kids Birthday / Children’s Day → By Color → Macaron Pastel Mixed Tone → Recipient → Family Guests → Product Type → Pastel Kids Birthday Balloon Backdrop Decor Kit</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:44:02', '2026-07-23 17:44:02'),
