(18553, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 332, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create a dreamy pastel birthday backdrop with this pink and rose gold balloon set.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This kit features a rose gold “HAPPY BIRTHDAY” foil letter banner, paired with a large rose gold crown foil balloon and a cute unicorn foil balloon. It includes star foil balloons in blue and rose gold, a colorful pennant banner, and soft matte pink latex balloons. Perfect for girls’ birthdays, unicorn-themed parties, or any sweet, pastel celebration.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dreamy pink and rose gold color scheme with unicorn accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes “HAPPY BIRTHDAY” banner and crown/unicorn foil balloons</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Colorful pennant banner adds extra festive charm</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rose gold “HAPPY BIRTHDAY” foil letter banner: 1 set</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><