(18945, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 348, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description: All-in-one silver mixed balloon set creates stylish wall backdrops for adult and children birthday gatherings.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description: This DIY birthday decor pack contains shaped aluminum foil balloons, round latex balloons and a black pennant birthday banner. It comes with practical assembly accessories for easy backdrop setup for party guests. Multiple SKU variants offer different balloon collocations to match various birthday theme styles.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Combination of aluminum foil shaped balloons and round latex balloons</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Built-in champagne &amp; wine cup foil ornaments and birthday letter banner</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Complete auxiliary tools for quick party backdrop assembly</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes: 1 set silver Happy Birthday letter foil balloons, 2 pcs 18-inch silver star foil balloons, 2 pcs 10-inch silver star foil balloons, 1 black Happy Birthday pennant banner, 1 champagne bottle foil balloon, 1 wine glass foil balloon, 10 black latex balloons, 10 white latex balloons, 1 ribbon roll, 1 balloon inflator, 1 pack dot glue, 1 piec