(19113, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 355, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create a luxurious, regal birthday backdrop with this black, gold, and silver crown balloon kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This kit features latex balloons in black, metallic gold, and silver, paired with a large golden crown foil balloon, a black heart foil balloon, and a silver \"Happy Birthday\" letter banner. It also includes dot glue and a balloon chain for easy assembly. The sleek, metallic color scheme creates a sophisticated, celebratory atmosphere perfect for adult birthday parties.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Luxurious black, gold, and silver color scheme with crown accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes latex balloons, foil shapes, and a birthday banner</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Comes with assembly tools for quick party setup</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">JT-SR01-1 / JT-SR01-2 / JT-SR01-3 / JT-SR01-4 / JT-SR01-5 / JT-SR01-6 / JT-SR01-7 / JT-SR01-8 / JT-SR01-9 / JT-SR01-10 / JT-SR01-11 / JT-SR01-12 / JT-SR01-13 / JT-SR01-14 / JT-SR01-15 / JT-SR01-16 / JT-SR01-17 variants available</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Latex</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Size:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">29x25cm (package size)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Birthday parties, adult celebrations, anniversary parties, party backdrops</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Balloons are shipped uninflated. Pictures are for reference only.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Birthday → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Balloon Garland Kit</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:48:45', '2026-07-23 17:48:45'),
