(19173, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 357, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create a spooky yet fun Halloween atmosphere with this colorful balloon set.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This kit features a whimsical “HAPPY HALLOWEEN” banner, paired with themed foil balloons including an eyeball, spider, pumpkin, bat, and “Happy Halloween” print balloons. It includes a vibrant mix of latex balloons in purple, orange, green, pink, and yellow for a playful, spooky look. Perfect for Halloween parties, haunted house events, or trick-or-treat gatherings.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vibrant multicolor design with playful spooky accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes “HAPPY HALLOWEEN” themed banner and foil balloons</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Mix of bright latex balloons for a layered, eye-catching look</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">“HAPPY HALLOWEEN” themed paper banner: 1 set</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\