(19191, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 358, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create a bold, dramatic birthday backdrop with this purple and black moon star balloon kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This kit features latex balloons in deep purple, light purple, and black, paired with celestial foil accents including crescent moons, stars, and heart shapes. It also includes dot glue and a balloon chain for easy assembly. The striking color scheme creates a modern, sophisticated atmosphere perfect for adult birthday celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Bold purple and black color scheme with celestial accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes latex balloons, foil shapes, and assembly tools</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Versatile design for modern and stylish birthday events</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">JT-SR02-1 / JT-SR02-2 / JT-SR02-3 / JT-SR02-4 / JT-SR02-5 / JT-SR02-6 / JT-SR02-7 / JT-SR02-8 / JT-SR02-9 / JT-SR02-10 / JT-SR02-11 / JT-SR02-12 variants available</span></p><p><span 