(19691, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 377, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description: Complete balloon and tool kit lets you build romantic custom car trunk surprise layouts for meaningful celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description: This DIY decorating pack combines aluminum foil shaped balloons, 10-inch round latex balloons and practical assembly accessories. Mixed color matching suits multiple celebration themes for party guests. Multiple SKU variants offer different layout combinations to fit various car trunk sizes.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Mix of aluminum foil shaped balloons and 10-inch latex round balloons</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Comes with essential decorating auxiliary tools for easy assembly</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Multiple SKU variants with different component combinations</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes: Balloon inflator, 1 roll of dot glue; Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Available Options: SKU Q-6 series including model 501, 502, 503, 504, 505, 506, 507, 508, 509, 510, 511, 512, 51