(19719, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 378, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Create a romantic, festive backdrop with this pink and rose gold Valentine’s Day balloon garland kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This kit features soft pink, rose gold, and white latex balloons, paired with romantic foil accents including heart shapes, lips, a lipstick, and a cursive \"love\" balloon. It also includes dot glue and a balloon chain for easy assembly. The warm, pink palette creates a loving, elegant atmosphere perfect for Valentine’s Day, weddings, and proposals.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Romantic pink and rose gold color scheme with heart and love accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Includes latex balloons, themed foil shapes, and assembly tools</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Versatile design for Valentine’s Day, weddings, and anniversary events</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">JT-QRJ01 / JT-QRJ02 / JT-QRJ03 / JT-QRJ04 / JT-QRJ05 / JT-QRJ06 / JT-QRJ07 / JT-QRJ09 / JT-QRJ10 / JT-QRJ11 / JT-QRJ12 / J