(19789, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 381, 'description', '<p>Short Description: Complete balloon and tool kit lets you build romantic custom car trunk surprise layouts for meaningful celebrations.</p><p>Long Description: This DIY decorating pack combines aluminum foil shaped balloons, 10-inch round latex balloons and practical assembly accessories. Mixed color matching suits multiple celebration themes for party guests. Multiple SKU variants offer different layout combinations to fit various car trunk sizes.</p><p>Key Features:</p><p>Mix of aluminum foil shaped balloons and 10-inch latex round balloons</p><p>Comes with essential decorating auxiliary tools for easy assembly</p><p>Multiple SKU variants with different component combinations</p><p>Package Includes: Balloon inflator, 1 roll of dot glue; Package contents depend on the selected option.</p><p>Available Options: SKU Q-6 series including model 501, 502, 503, 504, 505, 506, 507, 508, 509, 510, 511, 512, 513, 514, 515, 516, 517, 518, 519, 520, 521, 522, 523, 524, 525, 526, 527, 528, 529, 530, 531, 532</p><p>Material: Aluminum foil, latex</p><p>Size: 10 inch latex balloons</p><p>Suitable For: Birthday parties, wedding proposals, wedding anniversaries, Children’s Day, Qixi Festival</p><p>Note: Balloons are shipped uninflated; LED letter lights and flower props shown in pictures are not included.</p><p>Category Path:</p><p>By Occasion → Birthday / Proposal / Anniversary → By Color → Mixed Tone → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Car Trunk Surprise Balloon Decor Kit</p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:52:07', '2026-07-23 17:52:07'),
