(19873, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 384, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Celebrate the new year with this sleek black and gold party balloon set.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This kit features a \"Happy New Year\" pennant banner, shiny gold \"2026\" number balloons, and a shimmering gold tinsel curtain backdrop. It includes printed latex balloons and star-shaped foil balloons with \"Happy New Year\" messages, creating a festive, glamorous look for New Year’s Eve parties.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Elegant black and gold color scheme with metallic accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes \"Happy New Year\" banner and \"2026\" number balloons</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Printed latex and star foil balloons add festive charm</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Black \"Happy New Year\" pennant banner with gold text: 1 set</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></sp