(19946, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 386, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Create a magical underwater party atmosphere with this mermaid-themed balloon garland kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This all-in-one kit features latex balloons in soft ocean tones: teal, pink, purple, and silver, paired with whimsical foil accents including mermaid tails, seashells, and a cute mermaid character. It also includes dot glue and a balloon chain for easy assembly. The pastel underwater design is perfect for kids’ mermaid-themed birthdays and ocean celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Soft ocean-inspired color scheme with mermaid and shell accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Includes latex balloons, themed foil shapes, and assembly tools</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Whimsical design perfect for kids’ underwater-themed parties</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">JT-MRY01 / JT-MRY02 / JT-MRY03 / JT-MRY04 / JT-MRY05 / JT-MRY06 / JT-MRY07 / JT-MRY08 / JT-MRY09 / JT-MRY10 / JT-MRY11 / JT-MRY12 variants available</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Latex, Aluminum Foil</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Size:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">10 inch (balloons)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Kids’ birthday parties, mermaid-themed celebrations, ocean-themed events, party backdrops</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Balloons are shipped uninflated. Pictures are for reference only.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Birthday → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Balloon Garland Kit</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:52:42', '2026-07-23 17:52:42'),
