(19971, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 387, 'summary', 'This vintage vertical striped zipper-style trolley suitcase is constructed from scratch-resistant lightweight PC hard shell, fitted with four solid aluminum alloy anti-collision corner protectors to buffer impact and reduce surface abrasion. It adopts full zipper expandable design, equipped with reliable built-in anti-theft combination lock, multi-stage adjustable telescopic pull handle and silent 360° multi-direction spinner wheels, suitable for family vacations, business trips and student seasonal travel.', '2026-07-23 17:52:50', '2026-07-23 17:52:50'),
(19972, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 387, 'description', '<table><tbody><tr><td data-row=\"1\">ItemDetails</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"2\">Product Type</td><td data-row=\"2\">Retro Vertical Rib PC Hard Shell Zipper Rolling Suitcase with Aluminum Alloy Corner Guards</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"3\">Color</td><td data-row=\"3\">Cream White Vertical Ribbed PC Hard Shell</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"4\">Material</td><td data-row=\"4\">Scratch Resistant Hard PC Shell + Aluminum Alloy Anti-Collision Corner Guards</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"5\">Structure</td><td data-row=\"5\">Vertical striped exterior, four-corner metal corner protectors, full zipper opening design, built-in digital combination lock, multi-stage adjustable telescopic handle, silent 360° spinner wheels, top &amp; side dual hand grips</td></tr></tbody></table><ol><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Four-corner aluminum alloy guards for anti-collision and anti-scratch protection</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Scratch-resistant vertical ribbed lightweight PC hard shell exterior</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Full zipper expandable structure for flexible storage capacity</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Secure built-in digital anti-theft combination lock for valuables</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Silent 360° rotating smooth multi-direction spinner wheels</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Clean cream white retro hard shell rolling suitcase made of sturdy scratch-proof PC material with vertical rib texture. Reinforced aluminum alloy corner guards effectively resist impact damage, zipper expandable design and quiet spinner wheels deliver stable storage and effortless rolling experience for travel, business visits and holiday outings.</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Business travelers for short and medium-distance work trips</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Vacationers for weekend getaways and long holiday travel</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Students for school relocation and seasonal travel</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Daily travelers pursuing durable vintage trolley luggage</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Color may vary slightly due to different shooting lighting</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 31, 35); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may have an error of 1–3 cm</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:52:50', '2026-07-23 17:52:50'),
