(20226, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 393, 'summary', 'This vintage vertical striped zipper-style mini trolley suitcase is crafted from scratch-resistant PC hard shell with metal anti-collision corner guards. It integrates two practical travel functions: external USB charging interface and front foldable beverage cup holder, matched with silent 360° multi-direction spinner wheels, built-in combination lock and multi-stage adjustable telescopic handle to bring convenience for overnight business trips, weekend getaways and student short breaks.', '2026-07-23 17:53:39', '2026-07-23 17:53:39'),
(20227, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 393, 'description', '<table><tbody><tr><td data-row=\"1\"> ItemDetails</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"2\">Product Type</td><td data-row=\"2\">Retro Vertical Rib Multi-Functional PC Hard Shell Zipper Mini Carry On Rolling Suitcase</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"3\">Color</td><td data-row=\"3\">Grain White Vertical Ribbed PC Hard Shell</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"4\">Material</td><td data-row=\"4\">Scratch Resistant Hard PC Shell + Metal Anti-Collision Corner Guards</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"5\">Structure</td><td data-row=\"5\">Vertical striped exterior, full zipper opening design, external USB charging interface, front foldable cup holder, multi-stage adjustable telescopic handle, built-in digital combination lock, silent 360° spinner wheels, top &amp; side dual hand grips</td></tr></tbody></table><ol><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vertical ribbed scratch-resistant PC hard shell with metal anti-collision corner guards</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Full zipper expandable opening design for flexible storage capacity</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">External built-in USB charging port for on-the-go device power supply</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Front foldable hidden cup holder to hold coffee and drink cups</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Silent 360° rotating smooth multi-direction spinner wheels</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Elegant grain white mini zipper rolling suitcase made of durable scratch-proof PC material with retro vertical rib texture and reinforced metal corners. Equipped with external USB charging function and integrated foldable cup holder, quiet spinner wheels and safety combination lock, the compact size perfectly meets storage demands for short business trips, weekend outings and overnight travel.</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Office workers for overnight short-distance business trips</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vacationers for weekend mini getaways and one-day outings</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Students for short school breaks and weekend home visits</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Daily travelers needing charging and drink storage functions during trips</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Color may vary slightly due to different shooting lighting</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may have an error of 1–3 cm</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:53:39', '2026-07-23 17:53:39'),
