(20349, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 397, 'summary', 'This vintage vertical striped zipper-style mini trolley suitcase is crafted from scratch-resistant PC hard shell with metal anti-collision corner guards. It integrates two practical travel functions: external USB charging interface and front foldable beverage cup holder, matched with silent 360° multi-direction spinner wheels, built-in combination lock and multi-stage adjustable telescopic handle to bring convenience for overnight business trips, weekend getaways and student short breaks.', '2026-07-23 17:54:07', '2026-07-23 17:54:07'),
