(20469, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 401, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Create a spooky, fun Halloween atmosphere with this themed balloon garland kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This all-in-one kit features latex balloons in classic Halloween colors: orange, black, purple, and green, paired with playful foil accents including ghosts, pumpkins, bats, and a spooky character. It also includes dot glue and a balloon chain for easy assembly. The whimsical yet spooky design is perfect for Halloween parties and haunted-themed celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Classic Halloween color scheme with ghost, pumpkin, and bat accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Includes latex balloons, themed foil shapes, and assembly tools</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Versatile design for Halloween parties and haunted events</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">JT-WS01 / JT-WS02 / JT-WS03 / JT-WS04 / JT-WS05 / JT-WS06 / JT-WS07 / JT-WS08 / JT-WS09 / JT-WS10 / JT-WS11 / JT-WS12 / JT-WS13 / JT-WS14 / JT-WS15 / 