(20897, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 415, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create a charming, playful kids’ birthday backdrop with this blue Ins-style balloon kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This kit features light blue and gray latex balloons, paired with playful foil accents like airplanes, cars, rainbows, and a smiling flower. It also includes a colorful \"Happy Birthday\" banner and vehicle-themed garland, plus dot glue and ribbon for easy setup. The soft pastel palette creates a gentle, whimsical vibe perfect for kids’ birthday celebrations.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Soft blue and gray pastel color scheme with playful accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes latex balloons, cute foil shapes, and birthday banners</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Comes with assembly tools for quick party prep</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">JT-INS01 / JT-INS02 / JT-INS03 / JT-INS04 / JT-INS05 / JT-INS06 / JT-INS07 / JT-INS08 / JT-INS09 / JT-INS10 / JT-INS11 / JT-INS12 / JT-INS13 / JT-INS14 / JT-INS15 / JT-INS16 / JT-INS17 variants available</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Latex</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Size:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">12 inch (balloons)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Kids’ birthday parties, family gatherings, themed celebrations, party backdrops</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Balloons are shipped uninflated. Pictures are for reference only.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Birthday → By Color → Blue → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Balloon Garland Kit</span></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:56:34', '2026-07-23 17:56:34'),
