(21424, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 430, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create a cosmic, space-themed birthday backdrop with this astronaut balloon kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This all-in-one kit features deep blue, light blue, and silver latex balloons, paired with astronaut, rocket, and UFO foil accents. It also includes a \"Happy Birthday\" banner with space-themed details, plus dot glue and ribbon for easy assembly. The starry, galaxy-inspired design creates a fun, adventurous vibe perfect for a child’s birthday celebration.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Cosmic blue and silver color scheme with space-themed accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes latex balloons, astronaut foil shapes, and a birthday banner</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Comes with assembly tools for quick party setup</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">JT-TK02 / JT-TK03 / JT-TK04 / JT-TK05 / JT-TK07 / JT-ATM02 / JT-ATM03 / JT-ATM04 / JT-ATM05 / JT-ATM06 / JT-ATM07 / JT-ATM08 / JT-ATM09 / JT-ATM10 / JT-ATM11 / JT-QC01 / JT-QC02 / JT-QC05 / JT-QC06 variants available</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package contents depend on the selected option.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Latex</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Size:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">12 inch (balloons)</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Boys’ birthday parties, space-themed celebrations, kids parties, family gatherings</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Balloons are shipped uninflated. Pictures are for reference only.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Category Path:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">By Occasion → Birthday → By Color → Multicolor → Recipient → Party Guests → Product Type → Balloon Garland Kit</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 17:58:35', '2026-07-23 17:58:35'),
