(21758, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 439, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create a sweet, playful birthday scene with this pink-themed balloon kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This set features soft pink latex balloons paired with cute foil balloons including a polka-dot bow, daisy flower, and bear. It includes a \"Happy Birthday\" banner to complete the look, plus assembly tools to help you set up easily. The cheerful pink design is perfect for kids\' birthday parties.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Sweet pink color scheme with playful accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes bow, daisy, and bear foil balloons</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Comes with a \"Happy Birthday\" banner and assembly tools</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\"Happy Birthday\" banner: 1 pc</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">10\" pink latex balloons: 20 pcs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\"Happy Birthday To You\" printed balloons: 4 pcs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Polka-dot bow foil balloon: 1 pc</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Daisy flower foil balloon: 1 pc</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Bear foil balloon: 1 pc</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Confetti balloon: 3 pcs</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Balloon tie tool: 1 pc</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Balloon arch tape: 1 pc</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Material:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Latex, foil, paper</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Suitable For:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Kids\' birthday parties, girls\' themed celebrations, casual home parties</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Note:</span></p><p><span style=\"backgrou