resh mint green retro hard shell rolling suitcase crafted from durable scratch-proof PC material with vertical rib texture. Reinforced aluminum corner protectors reduce impact damage, zipper-style expandable structure and quiet spinner wheels bring convenient storage and smooth rolling experience for travel use.</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Business travelers for medium and short-distance work trips</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vacationers for weekend getaways and long holiday travel</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Students for school relocation and seasonal travel</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Daily travelers pursuing vintage durable trolley luggage</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Color may vary slightly due to different shooting lighting</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may have an error of 1–3 cm</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 18:01:24', '2026-07-23 18:01:24'),
(22130, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 450, 'meta_keywords', 'retro vertical rib pc luggage,rolling suitcase with aluminum corner protectors,zipper type hard shell trolley case,scratch resistant travel spinner luggage,mint green vintage carry on suitcase', '2026-07-23 18:01:24', '2026-07-23 18:01:24'),
(22131, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 450, 'meta_description', 'Shop mint green retro vertical rib hard shell rolling luggage with aluminum anti-collision corner protectors, zipper expandable design and quiet spinner wheels, durable trolley suitcase for vacation, business and student travel.', '2026-07-23 18:01:24', '2026-07-23 18:01:24'),
