(22598, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 464, 'description', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Create an elegant party backdrop with this blue macaron balloon garland kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">This kit features latex balloons in soft blue, white, silver, and blue confetti finishes, designed to form a beautiful balloon arch. It includes dot glue and a balloon chain for easy assembly, making party prep simple. The cool blue palette is perfect for birthdays, baby showers, and grand openings.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Soft blue, white, and silver color scheme with confetti accents</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Includes latex balloons and assembly tools for easy setup</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Versatile design for multiple celebration occasions</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Available Options:</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">JT-0011 / JT-0010 / JT-0002 / JT-0008 / JT-0009 / JT-0001 / JT-0004 / JT-0005 / JT-0015 / JT-0007 / JT-0013 / JT-0016 / JT-0018 / JT-0028 / JT-0029 / JT-0030 variants available</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0,