(22913, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 473, 'description', '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Short Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Create a glamorous party backdrop with this black, rose gold and blush pink balloon kit.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Long Description:</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">This balloon garland set combines classic black, metallic rose gold, and soft blush pink tones for a modern, sophisticated look. The kit includes starburst foil balloons and a mix of latex balloons in various sizes. All assembly tools are included to help you build a show-stopping arch easily.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Key Features:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Elegant black, rose gold, and blush pink color palette</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Includes starburst foil balloons for a glamorous touch</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">All assembly tools are included for easy setup</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Package Includes:</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">5\" latex balloons: 25 pcs (black/rose gold)</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb