ertical striped hard shell rolling suitcase made of sturdy scratch-proof PC material, equipped with USB charging, foldable cup rack and side tote hook. Smooth silent spinner wheels and adjustable pull handle deliver hassle-free experience for all travel plans.</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Business travelers for short and medium-distance work trips</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Holiday visitors for weekend getaways and long vacations</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Students for school transfers and seasonal travel</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Daily travelers who frequently carry drinks and shopping bags</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Color may vary slightly due to different shooting lighting</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may have an error of 1–3 cm</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 18:06:17', '2026-07-23 18:06:17'),
