(23518, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 489, 'description', '<p>Built-in water bottle holder</p><p>Multi-compartment zippered pockets</p><p>Adjustable waist strap</p><p>Quick-release buckles</p><p>Low-profile design</p><p><br></p><p>4) Brief English Product Description</p><p>This digital jungle camouflage tactical waist bag features a water bottle holder, multiple pockets, and an adjustable strap to organize small outdoor items.</p><p><br></p><p>5) Specifications Table</p><p>| Parameter | Details |</p><p>| --- | --- |</p><p>| Product Type | Tactical Waist Bag with Water Bottle Holder |</p><p>| Color | Digital jungle camouflage |</p><p>| Closure | Zipper closure |</p><p>| Features | Water bottle holder, multi-compartment pockets, adjustable waist strap, quick-release buckles |</p><p><br></p><p>6) Target Users / Usage Scenarios</p><p>For outdoor hiking activities</p><p>For casual daily carry</p><p>For short-distance outdoor trips</p><p>For sports and fitness use</p><p><br></p><p>7) Gentle Reminder</p><p>Due to different lighting conditions during photography, the actual color may vary slightly.</p><p>Manual measurement may result in a 1–3 cm size deviation.</p>', '2026-07-23 18:07:10', '2026-07-23 18:07:10'),
