(23583, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 491, 'summary', 'This tough hard shell trolley suitcase is made of thick scratch-resistant PC material with vertical ribbed surface. It comes with a built-in side load-bearing hook for hanging shopping bags, multi-stage adjustable telescopic handle, built-in combination lock and silent 360-degree spinner wheels, delivering practical storage and smooth rolling experience for all travel plans.', '2026-07-23 18:07:26', '2026-07-23 18:07:26'),
(23584, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 491, 'description', '<table><tbody><tr><td data-row=\"1\"> ItemDetails</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"2\">Product Type</td><td data-row=\"2\">Rigid PC Hard Shell Rolling Travel Trolley Suitcase with Side Hook</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"3\">Color</td><td data-row=\"3\">Dark Gray Vertical Ribbed PC Hard Shell</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"4\">Material</td><td data-row=\"4\">Thick Scratch Resistant PC Hard Shell</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"5\">Structure</td><td data-row=\"5\">Vertical striped exterior, side load-bearing shopping bag hook, built-in combination lock, multi-stage adjustable telescopic handle, silent 360° spinner wheels, top &amp; side dual hand grips</td></tr></tbody></table><ol><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Thick scratch resistant rigid PC hard shell construction</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Side built-in hook to hang shopping bags and totes</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Secure integrated anti-theft combination lock</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Silent 360° rotating multi-direction spinner wheels</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Multi-stage adjustable aluminum telescopic pull handle</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dark gray vertical striped hard shell rolling suitcase crafted from sturdy scratch-proof PC material. The practical side hook frees your hands during outings, matched with smooth spinner wheels and reliable lock system, suitable for business trips, holidays and student travel.</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Business travelers for medium and short-distance work trips</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Vacationers for weekend getaways and long holiday travel</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Students for school relocation and seasonal travel</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Daily travelers who carry shopping bags while traveling</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Color may vary slightly due to different shooting lighting</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may have an error of 1–3 cm</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 18:07:26', '2026-07-23 18:07:26'),
