n></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Due to different lighting conditions, the actual color may vary slightly from the product picture.</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Please allow 1-3cm size deviation due to manual measurement.</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 18:09:43', '2026-07-23 18:09:43'),
