(24376, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 514, 'summary', 'This slim structured hard shell backpack is crafted from water-repellent smooth fabric matched with synthetic leather edge trim. It maintains a neat fixed shape without collapsing, equipped with a built-in padded laptop compartment, compact top hand handle and wide breathable mesh shoulder straps to hold laptops, documents and daily office supplies for daily work and short business trips.', '2026-07-23 18:10:37', '2026-07-23 18:10:37'),
(24377, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 514, 'description', '<table><tbody><tr><td data-row=\"1\"> ItemDetails</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"2\">Product Type</td><td data-row=\"2\">Structured Hard Shell Men Business Laptop Backpack</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"3\">Color</td><td data-row=\"3\">Navy Blue Smooth Fabric with Black Synthetic Leather Trim</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"4\">Closure</td><td data-row=\"4\">Side full-length main zipper</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"5\">Structure</td><td data-row=\"5\">Rigid water-repellent hard shell fabric, synthetic leather edge trim, padded compartment for 15.6-inch laptop, compact top hand grab handle, wide breathable mesh padded shoulder straps</td></tr></tbody></table><ol><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rigid hard shell to keep neat non-deformable shape</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Water repellent fabric blocks daily liquid splashes</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Synthetic leather trim improves wear resistance</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Padded inner compartment fits 15.6-inch laptop</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Wide mesh shoulder straps for long-time comfort</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Navy blue slim hard shell men business backpack made of water-resistant fabric with synthetic leather edging. The rigid exterior avoids sagging, multi-layer internal storage arranges work items orderly, paired with comfortable shoulder straps for daily office and business travel use.</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Male office workers for daily commute and regular office work</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Business staff for client visits and negotiation meetings</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Short-distance business travelers for overnight work trips</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Users who prefer slim structured non-deformable backpacks</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Color may vary slightly due to different shooting lighting</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may have an error of 1–3 cm</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 18:10:37', '2026-07-23 18:10:37'),
