(24716, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 527, 'summary', 'This women’s daily backpack is constructed from smooth water-repellent woven fabric with multi independent zipper compartments on front and sides. It features a padded laptop sleeve, soft top grab handle and breathable mesh shoulder straps, offering ample storage space for laptops, stationery and daily personal items for school, office and casual trips.', '2026-07-23 18:12:27', '2026-07-23 18:12:27'),
(24717, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 527, 'description', '<table><tbody><tr><td data-row=\"1\"> ItemDetails</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"2\">Product Type</td><td data-row=\"2\">Multi-Zipper Water Resistant Women Daily Laptop Backpack</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"3\">Color</td><td data-row=\"3\">Pure Matte Black Woven Fabric</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"4\">Closure</td><td data-row=\"4\">Multi independent front &amp; side zipper closure</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"5\">Structure</td><td data-row=\"5\">Water-repellent woven fabric, multi zipper storage pockets, padded 14-inch laptop compartment, soft top grab handle, breathable mesh padded shoulder straps</td></tr></tbody></table><ol><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Multi-layer independent zipper storage compartments</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Smooth water repellent woven fabric surface</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Spacious interior holds daily necessities well</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Padded protective sleeve for 14-inch laptop</span></li><li data-list=\"ordered\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Breathable mesh shoulder straps for comfort</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All-black lightweight women backpack crafted from water-resistant woven fabric, designed with abundant front and side zipper pockets for classified storage. Built-in laptop interlayer and comfortable shoulder straps make it a practical daily bag for campus, workplace and casual outings.</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Female students for daily classes and campus activities</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Office ladies for regular commute and after-work shopping</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Casual travelers for short-distance city sightseeing trips</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Daily users carrying laptop, cosmetics and personal belongings</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Color may vary slightly due to different shooting lighting</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may have an error of 1–3 cm</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 18:12:27', '2026-07-23 18:12:27'),
