(24892, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 534, 'summary', 'This fashion women’s casual backpack adopts flap drawstring double closure with two adjustable PU buckle straps, wear-resistant water-repellent nylon fabric, large front zipper compartment, bilateral side storage pockets, built-in padded laptop liner and breathable mesh shoulder straps, perfect for school, office commute, shopping and short trips.', '2026-07-23 18:13:15', '2026-07-23 18:13:15'),
(24893, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 534, 'description', '<table><tbody><tr><td data-row=\"1\"><br></td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"2\">Product Type</td><td data-row=\"2\">BANGE Women Flap Drawstring Casual Laptop Backpack</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"3\">Color</td><td data-row=\"3\">Matte Black Nylon</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"4\">Closure</td><td data-row=\"4\">Flip PU buckle + inner drawstring + front zipper closure</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"5\">Structure</td><td data-row=\"5\">Water-resistant nylon, dual buckle flip cover, drawstring main compartment, large front zipper pocket, bilateral side pockets, padded 14-inch laptop sleeve, breathable shoulder straps, top carry handle</td></tr></tbody></table><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Dual design: flip cover PU buckle + inner drawstring, safer storage and adjustable capacity</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Smooth water-repellent nylon fabric, stain-resistant, lightweight and easy to wipe clean</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Extra large front full-width zipper pocket for cosmetics, mobile phones and stationery</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Two side drawstring pockets for water bottles, folding umbrellas and small daily items</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Padded inner sleeve fits up to 14-inch notebook, relieve impact when carrying</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">All-black casual BANGE women backpack with flip drawstring design, lightweight waterproof nylon and multi-layer storage, ideal leisure bag for students, office ladies and daily city use.</span></p><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Female college students for daily classes</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Office ladies for daily commute and shopping</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Travelers for short-distance leisure trips</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Daily users to carry laptop and personal necessities</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Color may vary slightly due to different shooting lighting</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may have an error of 1–3 cm</span></li></ol><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 18:13:15', '2026-07-23 18:13:15'),
