(25072, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 542, 'summary', 'This slim rectangular laptop sleeve adopts textured diagonal spliced fabric, thick shock-absorbing inner padding, full zipper closure, rounded edge anti-collision design, and minimalist matte black exterior for daily laptop protection inside backpacks or briefcases.', '2026-07-23 18:14:12', '2026-07-23 18:14:12'),
(25073, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 542, 'description', '<table><tbody><tr><td data-row=\"1\"><br></td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"2\">Product Type</td><td data-row=\"2\">BANGE Diagonal Spliced Shockproof Laptop Sleeve</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"3\">Color</td><td data-row=\"3\">Matte Black Textured Woven Fabric</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"4\">Closure</td><td data-row=\"4\">Full side zipper closure</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"5\">Structure</td><td data-row=\"5\">Diagonal spliced exterior, thick shock-absorbing foam padding, water-resistant fabric, rounded anti-collision edges, slim lightweight body</td></tr></tbody></table><ol><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Unique diagonal splicing textured fabric for stylish minimalist look</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Thick shock-absorbing foam inner lining against bumps and drops</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Water-repellent exterior fabric blocks splashes and light stains</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Rounded all-round edge design to prevent corner collision damage</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Ultra-slim lightweight profile, easy to slide into backpacks or briefcases</span></li></ol><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Slim matte black BANGE shockproof laptop sleeve with padded shock-absorbing lining and diagonal splicing, providing lightweight all