(25651, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 566, 'description', '<p>Multi-compartment zippered pockets</p><p>Hook-and-loop patch panel</p><p>Side mesh water bottle pockets</p><p>Exterior webbing loops</p><p>Top fabric carry handle</p><p>4) Brief Product Description in English</p><p>This pink camo tactical backpack features divided compartments, a front patch panel, and side mesh pockets to organize belongings for daily use.</p><p>5) Specifications Table</p><p>| Parameter | Details |</p><p>| --- | --- |</p><p>| Product Type | Tactical Multi-Compartment Backpack |</p><p>| Color | Pink-green camouflage |</p><p>| Closure | Zipper closure |</p><p>| Features | Multi-compartment, hook-and-loop panel, side mesh pockets, exterior webbing loops |</p><p>6) Suitable People / Scenarios Short Sentences</p><p>For daily office commuting</p><p>For short-distance travel trips</p><p>For gym or sports activities</p><p>For everyday casual carrying</p><p>7) Gentle Reminder</p><p>Due to different lighting conditions during photography, the actual color may vary slightly.</p><p>Manual measurement may result in a 1–3 cm size deviation.</p>', '2026-07-23 18:16:56', '2026-07-23 18:16:56'),
