 photography, the actual color may vary slightly.</span></li><li data-list=\"bullet\"><span class=\"ql-ui\" contenteditable=\"false\"></span><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may result in a 1–3 cm size deviation.</span></li></ol><p><br></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 18:17:04', '2026-07-23 18:17:04'),
