ions during photography, the actual color may vary slightly.</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Manual measurement may result in a 1–3 cm size deviation.</span></p><p><br></p>', '2026-07-23 18:20:13', '2026-07-23 18:20:13'),
