(26614, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 606, 'description', '<p>Multi-compartment layout</p><p>Multiple front/side pockets</p><p>Adjustable binding straps</p><p>Exterior webbing loops</p><p>Large capacity structure</p><p><br></p><p>4) Brief Product Description in English</p><p>This CP camouflage backpack features divided compartments, multiple pockets, and binding straps to organize belongings for travel and outdoor use.</p><p><br></p><p>5) Specifications Table</p><p>| Parameter | Details |</p><p>| --- | --- |</p><p>| Product Type | Outdoor Multi-Compartment Backpack |</p><p>| Color | CP camouflage |</p><p>| Closure | Drawstring strap closure |</p><p>| Features | Multi-compartment, multiple pockets, adjustable binding straps, exterior webbing |</p><p><br></p><p>6) Applicable People / Scenes Short Phrases</p><p>For short-distance travel trips</p><p>For casual outdoor carrying</p><p>For large daily item storage</p><p>For daily outdoor use</p><p><br></p><p>7) Gentle Reminder</p><p>Due to different lighting conditions during photography, the actual color may vary slightly.</p><p>Manual measurement may result in a 1–3 cm size deviation.</p>', '2026-07-23 18:21:51', '2026-07-23 18:21:51'),
