(26751, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 611, 'summary', 'Soft plush fleece diaper caddy in neutral cream tone, designed with multiple divided pockets and reinforced top handles, perfect for organizing diapers, wipes, bottles and other baby essentials at home or on the go.', '2026-07-23 18:22:25', '2026-07-23 18:22:25'),
(26752, 1, 'App\\Models\\Product', 611, 'description', '<table><tbody><tr><td data-row=\"1\"> ParameterDetails</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"2\">Product Type</td><td data-row=\"2\">Plush Fleece Diaper Organizer Caddy</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"3\">Material</td><td data-row=\"3\">Soft Plush Fleece + Reinforced Lining</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"4\">Lining Material</td><td data-row=\"4\">Polyester Fabric</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"5\">Color</td><td data-row=\"5\">Cream White / Off White</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"6\">Closure</td><td data-row=\"6\">Open Top</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"7\">Applicable Grade</td><td data-row=\"7\">Newborn &amp; Infant Essentials Storage</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"8\">Applicable Age</td><td data-row=\"8\">0-3 Years Old</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"9\">Structure</td><td data-row=\"9\">Multi-divided Compartments, Front Side Pockets, Built-in Top Handles</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"10\">Features</td><td data-row=\"10\">Multi-pocket Organizer, Portable Carry, Collapsible, Soft Plush Texture</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"11\">Set Includes</td><td data-row=\"11\">1 x Diaper Caddy + 1pcs Teddy Bear Charm</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Made of soft, skin-friendly fleece fabric, this multi-compartment diaper caddy features a spacious main compartment and several side pockets, allowing you to organize diapers, wipes, bottles, lotions and other baby essentials neatly. The reinforced top handles make it easy to carry around the house or take on outings. The collapsible design allows it to be folded flat for compact storage when not in use.Soft plush fleece fabric, gentle to the touch</p><p>✅ Multiple divided compartments for classified storage</p><p>✅ Reinforced top handles for easy portability</p><p>✅ Adorable teddy bear charm decoration</p><p>✅ Collapsible design for convenient storage when not in use<span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Nursery and home diaper station organization</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Living room and bedroom baby essentials storage</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Travel and day trips with newborns</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Baby shower gift giving</span></p><p>Slight color difference may exist due to different shooting lighting.</p><p>Manual measurement may have 1-3cm error.</p>', '2026-07-23 18:22:25', '2026-07-23 18:22:25'),
