(26879, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 615, 'summary', 'This insulated cooler backpack is made of durable waterproof Oxford cloth with a sleek black body and contrasting white zipper trim. It features a spacious main insulated compartment, a front zipper pocket and two side mesh pockets, ideal for keeping food and drinks cold during outdoor picnics, hiking and camping trips.', '2026-07-23 18:22:51', '2026-07-23 18:22:51'),
(26880, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 615, 'description', '<table><tbody><tr><td data-row=\"1\"> ParameterDetails</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"2\">Product Type</td><td data-row=\"2\">Insulated Cooler Backpack</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"3\">Material</td><td data-row=\"3\">Waterproof Oxford Cloth</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"4\">Lining Material</td><td data-row=\"4\">PEVA Insulated Lining</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"5\">Color</td><td data-row=\"5\">Black with White Zipper Trim</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"6\">Closure</td><td data-row=\"6\">Dual Zipper Pulls</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"7\">Applicable Grade</td><td data-row=\"7\">Outdoor Enthusiasts, Picnic Lovers</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"8\">Applicable Age</td><td data-row=\"8\">16+ Years Old</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"9\">Structure</td><td data-row=\"9\">Top Insulated Compartment, Front Zipper Pocket, 2 Side Zipper Pockets</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"10\">Features</td><td data-row=\"10\">Waterproof, Insulated, Large Capacity, Multiple Compartments, Comfortable Carry</td></tr><tr><td data-row=\"11\">Set Includes</td><td data-row=\"11\">1 x Cooler Backpack</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Crafted from heavy-duty, water-resistant Oxford cloth, this cooler backpack features a fully insulated interior designed to keep food and drinks cold for hours. The top main compartment is perfect for storing ice packs, beverages and meals, while the front zipper pocket and side pockets provide additional space for utensils, napkins and other small essentials. The adjustable padded shoulder straps and reinforced top handle make it comfortable to carry on long hikes or to the beach. Durable waterproof Oxford cloth construction</p><p>✅ Spacious insulated main compartment</p><p>✅ Multiple zipper pockets for organized storage</p><p>✅ Comfortable padded shoulder straps and top handle</p><p>✅ Dual zipper pulls for easy access<span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Outdoor picnics and barbecues</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Beach trips and pool days</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Hiking, camping and tailgating</span></p><p><span style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Day trips and road travel</span></p><p>Slight color difference may exist due to different shooting lighting.</p><p>Manual measurement may have 1-3cm error.</p>', '2026-07-23 18:22:51', '2026-07-23 18:22:51'),
(26881, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 615, 'meta_keywords', 'cooler backpack,insulated picnic backpack,waterproof Oxford cooler bag,large capacity outdoor ice pack,hiking cooler backpack', '2026-07-23 18:22:51', '2026-07-23 18:22:51'),
(26882, 11, 'App\\Models\\Product', 615, 'meta_description', 'Stylish insulated cooler backpack with multiple storage compartments, waterproof Oxford fabric and comfortable padded shoulder straps, perfect for keeping food cold during all-day outdoor activities.', '2026-07-23 18:22:51', '2026-07-23 18:22:51'),
