ekend getaways</span></li>\r\n<li data-list=\"bullet\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Used as airline-approved carry-on luggage</span></li>\r\n<li data-list=\"bullet\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Ideal for professionals needing quick access to work items</span></li>\r\n<li data-list=\"bullet\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Due to different lighting conditions during photography, the actual color may vary slightly.</span></li>\r\n<li data-list=\"bullet\"><span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Please check airline carry-on size limits before purchase.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '2026-08-01 15:50:36', '2026-08-01 15:50:36'),
